(text "PB3 / TIM2_CH2 drives one SK6805-EC15 through a 5 V AHCT buffer. R31 holds data LOW on reset.\nD10 remains powered when sensor supplies are disabled. DOUT is unused.\nRGB patterns are firmware diagnostics, not an independent hardware power-good indicator." (at 15 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f4a626a6-7d2d-54fa-a2ac-c5a5599af36c"))
(embedded_fonts no))
